dogecoin.text:
@inevitable360 @Bitcoin @litecoin @dogecoin Dude. Seriously?

Your hashing security is literally derived from Litecoin for the past 10+ years.

So much for symbiotic relationships and working together, I guess.

@tjstebbing @lite_hause With all due respect, Tim, I think the amount of Litecoiners who support and invest in Doge is much larger than people realize.

They have been there supporting it for years like a brother. 

Bitcoin and Dogecoin are engrained in many of us at this point.
